                        <item xml:id="a3"> 
                           <locus from="92ra" to="92vb"/>
                           <desc type="Genealogy">A genealogy of a family tracing the lineage of a certain Yafǝqǝr Dammo (?). 
                              The second part of the Additio contains a note concerning a family rule governing bequests. 
                              It mentions priest (qasis) <persName ref="PRS15606TawaldaMed">Tawalda Madḫǝn</persName> (the one who wrote the note), 
                              priest (qes) <persName ref="PRS15607Tasfay">Tasfāy</persName>, priest (qes) <persName ref="PRS15608GabraHeywat">Gabra Ḥǝywat</persName>, and
                              priest (qes) <persName ref="PRS15609WaldaAbreha">Walda ʾAbrǝhā</persName>. It is written in a fine hand.</desc>
                           <quote xml:lang="am">ውልድ፡ የፍቅር፡ ደሞ፡ ተወለደ፡ ደሞም፡ ቄስ፡ ምእንቶ፡ ወለደ፡ ቄስ፡ ምእንቶም፡ ነማር<supplied reason="omitted">ያ</supplied>ም፡ ገለላዊት፡ ወለተ፡ ጽዮን፡
                              ወለደ፡ የነዚህ፡ ፍጎ፡ አቶ፡ መንበሩ፤ ነማርያም<add place="above">ን፡</add> ሐብቱ፡ ወልደ፡ ጋብር፡ ስቡን፡ ክርስቶሳዊት፡ 
                              ንግሥቲ፡ ወለደ፡ የነዚህ፡ ፍጎ፡ አቶ፡ ገብረ፡ አናንያ። <gap reason="omitted" resp="MK"/></quote>
                        </item>
                        
                        <item xml:id="a4"> 
                           <locus target="#93rb"/>
                           <desc type="DonationNote">A donation note of a book (possibly the present codex). The note mentions <persName ref="PRS15610GabraMed"><roleName type="function">Mamḥǝre</roleName> Gabra Madḫǝn</persName> and
                              <persName ref="PRS15611Hesh"><roleName type="function">Mamḥǝre</roleName> Ḥǝš</persName>. It was written by <persName ref="PRS15612WaldaSadqan">Walda Ṣādǝqān</persName>, in a very crude way. 
                              The ink has partly faded away.</desc>
                           <quote xml:lang="gez">በስመ፡ <gap reason="omitted" resp="MK"/> በስመ፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ ክቡር፡ ወልዑል፡ ፀሃፊአ፡ ወልደ፡ ጻድቃን፡ ወድ፡ መምሕሬ፡ ገብረ፡ መድኅን፡ ክቡር፡
                              ወልዑል፡ መፅሐፍ፡ ዘወሀቡኒ፡ አቦይ፡ መምሕሬ፡ ሕሽ፡</quote>
                        </item>
                        
